[I] CLI epub reader

[T] epr is a terminal EPUB reader written in Python with curses. It
[T] remembers the last read file and the reading position for each book,
[T] adapts to terminal resizing, supports EPUB3 without audio, regex search,
[T] opening images, vim-like key bindings and dark and light color schemes.

[U] https://github.com/wustho/epr

[A] Epr Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

